{"schema":"SDW_SCRIPTURE_CHAPTER_V1","revision":"52add6f41edc5dd9c21f65f02f933fbd1cec266285bee8bce249607475050398","canonicalSourceHash":"f9dfbce6dd2edfe4bb3b4690acd6622f392035be2b0349df98f3607f0a05f6c2","bookId":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verses":[{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":91,"verse_start":1,"verse_end":1,"verse_label":"1","text":"Listen, sons, to a father’s instruction. Pay attention and know understanding;","is_omitted":0,"source_line":291},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":92,"verse_start":2,"verse_end":2,"verse_label":"2","text":"for I give you sound learning. Don’t forsake my law.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":294},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":93,"verse_start":3,"verse_end":3,"verse_label":"3","text":"For I was a son to my father, tender and an only child in the sight of my mother.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":297},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":94,"verse_start":4,"verse_end":4,"verse_label":"4","text":"He taught me, and said to me: “Let your heart retain my words. Keep my commandments, and live.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":300},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":95,"verse_start":5,"verse_end":5,"verse_label":"5","text":"Get wisdom. Get understanding. Don’t forget, and don’t deviate from the words of my mouth.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":304},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":96,"verse_start":6,"verse_end":6,"verse_label":"6","text":"Don’t forsake her, and she will preserve you. Love her, and she will keep you.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":308},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":97,"verse_start":7,"verse_end":7,"verse_label":"7","text":"Wisdom is supreme. Get wisdom. Yes, though it costs all your possessions, get understanding.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":311},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":98,"verse_start":8,"verse_end":8,"verse_label":"8","text":"Esteem her, and she will exalt you. She will bring you to honor when you embrace her.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":315},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":99,"verse_start":9,"verse_end":9,"verse_label":"9","text":"She will give to your head a garland of grace. She will deliver a crown of splendor to you.”","is_omitted":0,"source_line":318},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":100,"verse_start":10,"verse_end":10,"verse_label":"10","text":"Listen, my son, and receive my sayings. The years of your life will be many.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":322},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":101,"verse_start":11,"verse_end":11,"verse_label":"11","text":"I have taught you in the way of wisdom. I have led you in straight paths.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":325},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":102,"verse_start":12,"verse_end":12,"verse_label":"12","text":"When you go, your steps will not be hampered. When you run, you will not stumble.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":328},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":103,"verse_start":13,"verse_end":13,"verse_label":"13","text":"Take firm hold of instruction. Don’t let her go. Keep her, for she is your life.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":331},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":104,"verse_start":14,"verse_end":14,"verse_label":"14","text":"Don’t enter into the path of the wicked. Don’t walk in the way of evil men.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":335},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":105,"verse_start":15,"verse_end":15,"verse_label":"15","text":"Avoid it, and don’t pass by it. Turn from it, and pass on.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":338},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":106,"verse_start":16,"verse_end":16,"verse_label":"16","text":"For they don’t sleep unless they do evil. Their sleep is taken away, unless they make someone fall.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":341},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":107,"verse_start":17,"verse_end":17,"verse_label":"17","text":"For they eat the bread of wickedness and drink the wine of violence.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":344},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":108,"verse_start":18,"verse_end":18,"verse_label":"18","text":"But the path of the righteous is like the dawning light that shines more and more until the perfect day.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":347},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":109,"verse_start":19,"verse_end":19,"verse_label":"19","text":"The way of the wicked is like darkness. They don’t know what they stumble over.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":350},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":110,"verse_start":20,"verse_end":20,"verse_label":"20","text":"My son, attend to my words. Turn your ear to my sayings.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":354},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":111,"verse_start":21,"verse_end":21,"verse_label":"21","text":"Let them not depart from your eyes. Keep them in the center of your heart.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":357},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":112,"verse_start":22,"verse_end":22,"verse_label":"22","text":"For they are life to those who find them, and health to their whole body.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":360},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":113,"verse_start":23,"verse_end":23,"verse_label":"23","text":"Keep your heart with all diligence, for out of it is the wellspring of life.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":363},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":114,"verse_start":24,"verse_end":24,"verse_label":"24","text":"Put away from yourself a perverse mouth. Put corrupt lips far from you.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":366},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":115,"verse_start":25,"verse_end":25,"verse_label":"25","text":"Let your eyes look straight ahead. Fix your gaze directly before you.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":369},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":116,"verse_start":26,"verse_end":26,"verse_label":"26","text":"Make the path of your feet level. Let all of your ways be established.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":372},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":4,"verse_ordinal":117,"verse_start":27,"verse_end":27,"verse_label":"27","text":"Don’t turn to the right hand nor to the left. Remove your foot from evil.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":375}]}